        "If others, please specify": "Not Assigned",
        "Description": "Not Assigned",
        "Root Cause Type": "Technical Factors",
        "Identified Root Cause": "Software Issues: Bugs, glitches, or compatibility problems in software systems.",
        "Identified Root cause of the Problem": "The engine is checking on the last 2 digit of the field 60 instead of the actual digit placement of position 9-10.  Thus, if more than 10 digit was received in field 60, the engine will pick up the incorrect value.",
        "Findings": "The transaction was declined with response code: 58, Trxn not Permitted to Merchant|E-Commerce Blocked. \n\nThe POS terminal indicator received an unexpected value  in Field 60 -010000000702  that has 12 digit instead of the usual 10 digit. Thus, the Field 60.8 which is ECI code was erroneously pick up in position 11-12  instead of position 9-10. \n\nThe value of \"02\" was pickup which is not a valid ECI indicator It should be pick up the ECI code in position 9-10 which has a value \"07\" non-secure authentication. Other values supporte are 05 and 06.  \n\n05- fully authenticated CAVV Verification submissions\n06- used for non-authenticated security transactions at a 3-D Secure-capable merchant. The merchant attempted to authenticate the cardholder using 3-D Secure.\n\nThe same logic is applied in the Transaction GUI pos terminal indicator.",
        "Action Performed": "Not Assigned",
        "Resolution:": "The engine has been modified to correctly pickup the Field 60.8 for the E-Commerce Indicator based on the digit placement of position 9-10 and not the last 2 digit of field 60.   Getting the more updated and latest simulator will be vital in validating the messages and ensuring proper handling.",
        "Involved Personnel/s": "this code was setup in 2022 by Christian Ballon. This has been resolved by Dennis Uy",
        "Lessons Learned": "Proper documentation is needed and also, getting the more updated and latest simulator will be vital in validating the messages",
        "Accomplished By": "Not Assigned",
        "Subject": "Declined Transaction Related Concern of PCH (ARGOS, CHRISTIAN SAAVEDRA) ; Business Card / 4617-64xx-xxxx-0030",
